/S /P
/E (To those grappling with promiscuity, same-sex attraction, or gender dysphoria, we direct them to the transforming power of God to lead us to holiness in conformity to His Son's image. While we embrace all who struggle with sin, we do not affirm anything contrary to God's Word. We believe Gods word teaches us that we can meet God exactly as we are, but his love will transform us. )
