<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (If you are in a same-sex relationship or marriage, you and your family are wholeheartedly welcome. While we are a welcoming - non-affirming" church, we greet, love, and respect all individuals without exception. Our teaching is rooted in the entirety of the Bible, which includes upholding the sacred union of one man and one woman in marriage. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [0 1]
>>
endobj
241 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Concerning same-sex marriages, we believe in honoring the sacred covenant established by God, which requires compliance with His terms. Marriage, as defined by God, is a covenant between Him, one man, and one woman. We invite you to explore God's love and His desire for a personal relationship with you, regardless of your current circumstances. We would love to walk with you on your Spiritual Journey. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [13 14]
