/E (We believe in adhering strictly to the biblical injunction to be controlled by the Holy Spirit in both our thoughts and behaviors. While some theological positions may advocate for the permissibility of alcohol consumption, we recognize the pervasive societal struggle with alcoholism and addiction. In light of this, we maintain our stance against all forms of alcohol consumption primarily with our Pastoral Team, Staff and Board Members.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [6]
