261 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (we strive to create an environment aligned with the activities and approval of the Holy Spirit. Our music selection is contemporary and thoughtfully curated to create a worshipful-Holy Spirit enriched environment. Our primary goal is to ensure that everyone who enters feels welcomed and encounters the genuine presence and power of the Holy Spirit. We view music and service flow as integral to pointing towards the ministry of the Word and at all times keeping Jesus front and center. Sunday services are intentionally designed to be evangelistic in nature, ensuring that first-time guests feel included and valued. We recognize that not everyone attending a service may already be saved, and we aim to reach out to all individuals, regardless of their background or experiences. We are mindful that attendees may come from diverse situations, including those who might be experiencing desperation, such as spending the weekend on a drug binge or encountering a traumatic situation. Our commitment is to honor and welcome all individuals equally, showing them the same respect and compassion.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [15]
>>
